{"t":"FIX","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"Comfort Systems USA, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Industrials","industry":"Engineering & Construction","employees":22700,"hq":"Houston, TX, United States","website":"https://comfortsystemsusa.com","summary_en":"Comfort Systems USA, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides mechanical and electrical installation, renovation, maintenance, repair, and replacement services for the mechanical and electrical services industry in the United States. The company operates through two segments: Mechanical and Electrical. It offers heating, ventilation, and air conditioning systems, as well as plumbing, electrical, piping and controls, off-site construction, monitoring, and fire protection. The company is also involved in the design, engineering, integration, installation, and start-up of mechanical, electrical, and plumbing (MEP) and related systems in new buildings; and renovation, expansion, maintenance, monitoring, repair, and replacement of systems in existing buildings. In addition, it provides remote monitoring of power usage, temperature, pressure, humidity and air flow for MEP and other building systems. The company serves building owners and developers, general contractors, architects, consulting engineers, and property managers in the commercial, industrial, and institutional markets. Comfort Systems USA, Inc. was founded in 1917 and is headquartered in Houston, Texas.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"Comfort Systems USA, Inc.는 자회사와 함께 미국의 기계 및 전기 서비스 산업을 위한 기계 및 전기 설치, 개조, 유지 관리, 수리 및 교체 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 기계 부문과 전기 부문이라는 두 부문으로 운영됩니다. 난방, 환기 및 공조 시스템은 물론 배관, 전기, 배관 및 제어, 외부 건설, 모니터링 및 화재 방지 기능도 제공합니다. 이 회사는 또한 신축 건물의 기계, 전기, 배관(MEP) 및 관련 시스템의 설계, 엔지니어링, 통합, 설치 및 시동에도 참여하고 있습니다. 기존 건물의 시스템 개조, 확장, 유지 관리, 모니터링, 수리 및 교체. 또한 MEP 및 기타 건물 시스템에 대한 전력 사용량, 온도, 압력, 습도 및 공기 흐름을 원격으로 모니터링할 수 있습니다. 이 회사는 상업, 산업 및 기관 시장의 건물 소유자 및 개발자, 일반 계약자, 건축가, 컨설팅 엔지니어 및 자산 관리자에게 서비스를 제공합니다. Comfort Systems USA, Inc.는 1917년에 설립되었으며 텍사스주 휴스턴에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":964.94,"mcap":33960415232.0,"pe":20.841038,"fpe":14.383889,"peg":0.3374,"ps":2.7074423,"pb":10.107576,"ev_ebitda":14.019,"div":0.41,"beta":1.643,"hi52":2073.99,"lo52":841.66},"fin":{"rev":12543356928.0,"rev_g":0.537,"eps_g":0.686,"gross":0.25698,"op":0.16469999,"net":0.1301,"roe":0.58608,"fcf":2128619008.0,"cash":2223799040.0,"debt":374432992.0,"de":11.227,"eps":46.3,"feps":67.08478},"own":{"short":0.0249,"inst":0.96005994,"insider":0.010880001},"analyst":{"n":9,"mean":1820.5555,"median":1895.0,"high":2053.0,"low":1050.0,"rec":"strong_buy","recMean":1.36364,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":0,"buy":9,"hold":2,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":0,"buy":9,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":0,"buy":9,"hold":1,"sell":0,"strongSell":0}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-10-26","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":1900.0,"priorPriceTarget":2225.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-26","Firm":"Oppenheimer","ToGrade":"Outperform","FromGrade":"Outperform","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":2000.0,"priorPriceTarget":2400.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-26","Firm":"Keybanc","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Lowers","currentPriceTarget":1979.0,"priorPriceTarget":2125.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-15","Firm":"Keybanc","ToGrade":"Overweight","FromGrade":"Overweight","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":2125.0,"priorPriceTarget":2110.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-08-21","Firm":"DA Davidson","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"","Action":"init","priceTargetAction":"Announces","currentPriceTarget":2100.0,"priorPriceTarget":0.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-07-27","Firm":"UBS","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":2225.0,"priorPriceTarget":2125.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-07-27","Firm":"Keyb